 "titulo": "Nobody walks the 4th floor after 3 AM 🏥 Part 1 #horror #shorts",
 "capa": "ROOM 418",
 "descripcion": "In this hospital, nobody walks the fourth floor after 3 AM. On her first night, Maya answered the call light in room 418. It has been empty for six years.\n\n> Part 2: {when_next}.\nWould you check the room?\n\nNarrated fiction. New part every day.\n#horror #horrorstories #scarystories #survival #creepypasta",
 "visual": "3d",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "Imagine a hospital where nobody walks the *fourth floor* after 3 AM.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Not the doctors, not the guards, not even the cleaning crew.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "During the day, it's a normal ward, full of noise and bad coffee.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "But at three, every nurse goes back to the station and stays there.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "They turn the radio up, and nobody looks down the corridor.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "*Maya* is new. On her first night, she thinks it's a prank.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "At 3:07, a call light turns on in the last room. *Room 418*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Room 418 has been empty for *six years*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay with me, because this is where it gets bad.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Maya grabs a flashlight and walks down the corridor, alone.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Behind her, the lights go out one by one as she passes.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "At the end of the hall, a stretcher is standing by the door.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Someone is lying under the sheet. *The sheet is breathing*.",
   "pausa": 0.7
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then, at the station, the nurses start screaming her name.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Maya turns around. The station is *completely dark*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "And the screaming is coming from room 418. Part two, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
